// PoolName : N` is parsed as a single fixed shape (like flags' 'flags
// Name WidthType' width check), not deferred to registry the way array
// dimensions are. A statement with the wrong token count, or missing the
// literal ':' in the fourth position, is rejected outright at parse time
// (phase 3), before registration ever runs.

